    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/181e6146bd8a724ac35d402a2570a09d.poster.avif?t=1754582347\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/181e6146bd8a724ac35d402a2570a09d.webp?t=1754582347\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself psychologically in a meaningful journey, where reality is clouded by blinding illusions, and inner demons literally become visible. Anku sees what others can't see: pesky red imps in the heads of surrounding crows. When these creatures become too great in number, Anku sets out on a journey to figure out what's going on, and find a way to rid the world of these plagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one has asked him to be saved. Could it all be in his head? What if Anku is mistaken? Or the opposite, what if he's the only one who can see the truth? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/d63696cb54c79ec6fcdda7a94269867b.poster.avif?t=1754582347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/d63696cb54c79ec6fcdda7a94269867b.webm?t=1754582347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique visual aesthetic \u2014 </strong>Immerse yourself in an imaginary world, filled with testing challenges and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The choice that matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult choices, especially when pesky demons are trying to trip you up. How will you act? Trust the advice of friends or rely on yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enigmas and secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to gain a better understanding of this world. Some will make you see things in a different light, while others will bring unexpected surprises. Will you be able to solve them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poignant story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore difficult questions: who are we, and how can we cope with loneliness? Where does imagination become reality? Who really need saving\u2014those around Anku or Anku himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/3a970bd866dd6a02acd532b52f4d64e7.poster.avif?t=1754582347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/3a970bd866dd6a02acd532b52f4d64e7.webm?t=1754582347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/181e6146bd8a724ac35d402a2570a09d.poster.avif?t=1754582347\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/181e6146bd8a724ac35d402a2570a09d.webp?t=1754582347\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself psychologically in a meaningful journey, where reality is clouded by blinding illusions, and inner demons literally become visible. Anku sees what others can't see: pesky red imps in the heads of surrounding crows. When these creatures become too great in number, Anku sets out on a journey to figure out what's going on, and find a way to rid the world of these plagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one has asked him to be saved. Could it all be in his head? What if Anku is mistaken? Or the opposite, what if he's the only one who can see the truth? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/d63696cb54c79ec6fcdda7a94269867b.poster.avif?t=1754582347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/d63696cb54c79ec6fcdda7a94269867b.webm?t=1754582347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique visual aesthetic \u2014 </strong>Immerse yourself in an imaginary world, filled with testing challenges and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The choice that matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult choices, especially when pesky demons are trying to trip you up. How will you act? Trust the advice of friends or rely on yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enigmas and secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to gain a better understanding of this world. Some will make you see things in a different light, while others will bring unexpected surprises. Will you be able to solve them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poignant story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore difficult questions: who are we, and how can we cope with loneliness? Where does imagination become reality? Who really need saving\u2014those around Anku or Anku himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/3a970bd866dd6a02acd532b52f4d64e7.poster.avif?t=1754582347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495730/extras/3a970bd866dd6a02acd532b52f4d64e7.webm?t=1754582347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
